uld you please draw a situation where Nazrin is sweating in the summer sun?\nThank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kasd_n432/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd780870/uploads/origins/b65092d9-6b64-4c45-be46-f10067cc91a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65a4ec96c7a146568d33fa1cf6268475", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd780870/uploads/origins/b65092d9-6b64-4c45-be46-f10067cc91a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65a4ec96c7a146568d33fa1cf6268475, https://si.imgix.net/fd780870/uploads/origins/b65092d9-6b64-4c45-be46-f10067cc91a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7215a11dac9b9ac3cb241f98c119bd1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd780870/uploads/origins/b65092d9-6b64-4c45-be46-f10067cc91a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1497852857144fa2ee7795168ed6322e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\nいつもあなたのイラストを見るのが大好きです！\nリクエストなのですが、ナズーリンを描いていただけませんか？\nドロワーズを履いたナズーリンが見たいです！\n構図はお任せします。\nありがとうございました！\n\nHello!\nI always love looking at your illustrations!\nFor my request, would you be able to draw Nazrin?\nI would like to see Nazrin wearing drawers!\nI'll leave the composition up to you.\nThank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}